As a customer:
- I would like to see a welcome message when I start the application.
- I would like to see a list of all library books
- I'd like the list of all books to include each book's Author and Year Published. (Like a table format: Title | Author | Year Published)
- instead of automatically seeing the book list, I would like to see a list of options and be able to choose one. For now, the only option should be 'List Books'.
  (Invalid Menu Option - “Select a valid option!”)
- I would like to continue choosing options until I choose to 'Quit'.
- I would like to know that a book has been checked out by seeing the message “Thank you! Enjoy the book”.
- I would like to be notified if the book I tried to check-out is not available by seeing the message, “That book is not available.”
    - I would like to be notified if the book I am returning belongs to this library by seeing the message, “Thank you for returning the book.”, so that I know I returned the book to the right library.
    - I would like to be notified if the book I am returning has not been added to this library by seeing the message, “That is not a valid book to return.”, so that I can return it to the correct library or fix my spelling error.

As a Librarian:
    - I would like customers to be able to check-out a book (Checked out books should not appear in the list of all library books).
    - I would like customers to be able to return a book (Returned books should appear in the list of library books).


